WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.405
Repair an agreement that sounds finished An agreement can look

00:00:04.405 --> 00:00:09.545
finished while hiding a serious gap Look for unlimited duties

00:00:09.545 --> 00:00:14.285
assumed monitoring payment rights that were not delegated and automatic

00:00:14.285 --> 00:00:20.470
after-hours availability Replace each vague promise with defined work conditions

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:25.005
an owner and the required confirmation A clause that honestly

00:00:25.005 --> 00:00:27.785
records a limit or an unknown is not defective for

00:00:27.785 --> 00:00:33.265
that reason Select every clause needing correction explain one repair

00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:35.200
in your own words
